### Anular guía por id
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/cancelForzaGuide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guideId": 22
}

### Anular guía por número de rastreo (serie + número: FD + 30854701)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/cancelForzaGuide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "FD30854701"
}

### Idempotencia: repetir la anulación devuelve alreadyCancelled = true sin llamar a Forza
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/cancelForzaGuide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "FD30854701"
}

### 400: trackingNumber inválido (sin serie o sin número)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/cancelForzaGuide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "30854701"
}
